<title>USA: PhyMatrix Corp issues 562,500 shares.</title>
<headline>PhyMatrix Corp issues 562,500 shares.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>PhyMatrix Corp said on Thursday that it had issued 562,500 of its shares for the purchase of two diagnostic imaging centers in Dade County, Fla.</p>
<p>The physician practice management company also said it had entered into a management agreement for a radiation therapy center in New York, involving a base management fee to PhyMatrix of roughly $400,000 per year.</p>
<p>&quot;The acquisition of these two diagnostic imaging centers in Dade County, Florida, is consistent with our strategy of further developing our local provider network in Florida,&quot; chief executive Abraham Gosman said.</p>
